### Auth.http
### T081b — HTTP requests for all auth endpoints
### Constitution Principle IV: .http files required for all primary API functions

@host = http://localhost:8000

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### POST /auth/anon — Create ANON identity (dev only)
### Returns: { identityId, displayName, identityType }
### Sets: .AspNetCore.Cookies session cookie
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────

POST {{host}}/auth/anon
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### GET /api/auth/me — Get current signed-in user
### Returns: { displayName, email } or { displayName: null, email: null } for guest
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{host}}/api/auth/me

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### GET /auth/login/microsoft — Initiate Microsoft OAuth flow
### Redirects to: https://login.microsoftonline.com/{tenantId}/oauth2/v2.0/authorize
### Requires: AzureAd config in appsettings (ClientId, TenantId, ClientSecret)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{host}}/auth/login/microsoft

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### GET /auth/callback — OAuth redirect callback (handled automatically by OIDC middleware)
### Called by Azure AD after successful authentication
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{host}}/auth/callback

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### POST /auth/logout — Sign out (cookie + OIDC)
### Clears all auth cookies and redirects to /
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────

POST {{host}}/auth/logout

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### GET /api/config — Feature flags and environment info
### Returns: { isDevelopment: bool }
### Used by Login.razor to conditionally show ANON button
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{host}}/api/config

###
